{"id":"a090dc1ec2052307","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-composition-closure.md","title":"Composition Closure","display":"df-composition-closure — Composition Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-composition-closure","aliases":["68-df-composition-closure"],"display":"df-composition-closure — Composition Closure","depends_on":["[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§5 composition and Proposition 5.2, p.9 / PDF 18","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-composition-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-composition-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition-closure — Composition Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5 composition and Proposition 5.2, p.9 / PDF 18"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_k,\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F_k,\\mathcal F\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c524671590651be2\" href=\"?note=c524671590651be2\" title=\"68-df-number-theoretic-function\">68-df-number-theoretic-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(h\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_i\\in\\mathcal F_n\">\\(g_i\\in\\mathcal F_n\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>）。空元组、空合取采用通常约定。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}\\)</span> 为以下引入的构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m}):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;((\\vec z,y)\\in h\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;((\\vec x,z_i)\\in g_i))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m}):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;((\\vec z,y)\\in h\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;((\\vec x,z_i)\\in g_i))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_m\\;\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(G\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m})\\in G)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_m\\;\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(G\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i&lt;m})\\in G)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §5.2，印刷 p.9 / PDF p.18，以图表达严格的偏函数复合。允许 m=0、n=0，修复旧式排除零元的问题。外层与所有内层图的单值性给出结果单值；\\mathcal F 本身满足封闭条件，所以交集族非空、交集也封闭。旧用法 Comp(h,g_1,…,g_m) 省略了元数；此处用 Comp_{m,n} 显式绑定它们，特别避免零个内层函数时输出元数不能确定的问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-number-theoretic-function","status":"resolved","id":"c524671590651be2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_k,\\mathcal F$ 见 [[68-df-number-theoretic-function]]。$F\\subseteq\\mathcal F$，$m,n\\in\\mathbb N$，$h\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$g_i\\in\\mathcal F_n$（$i<m$）。空元组、空合取采用通常约定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_k,\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"g_i\\in\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"i<m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i<m}):=\\{(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;((\\vec z,y)\\in h\\land\\forall i<m\\;((\\vec x,z_i)\\in g_i))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{\\mathrm{comp}}(F):=\\bigcap\\{G\\subseteq\\mathcal F:F\\subseteq G\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall h\\in G\\cap\\mathcal F_m\\;\\forall(g_i)_{i<m}\\in(G\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\;(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(h,(g_i)_{i<m})\\in G)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1713,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f5b8b347f696f58","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-composition-closure]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-composition-closure]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-composition-closure|df-composition-closure — Composition Closure]]"}],"outgoing":["c524671590651be2"]}